    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# \ud83d\ude80 Runpod \u2014 GPU Cluster Monitoring\n\nLive GPU, system, and fabric health for your multi-node training cluster.\n\n**Dashboards:**  [GPU Fleet Overview](/d/gpu-fleet-overview)  \u00b7  [GPU Utilization](/d/gpu-utilization)  \u00b7  [GPU Deep Dive](/d/gpu-deep-dive)  \u00b7  [Node & System](/d/cluster-node-system)  \u00b7  [Fabric & Interconnect](/d/cluster-fabric-interconnect)"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> \u26a0\ufe0f **Grafana state is ephemeral.** Dashboards, users, edits, and settings live on this Instant Cluster's `node-0` and **are wiped when the cluster is recreated.** Export anything you want to keep."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Avg GPU Utilization",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 40
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL)"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Fleet mean core utilization \u2014 the #1 efficiency number.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Idle GPUs (<5%)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL < 5) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "description": "GPUs sitting idle = wasted spend; in collective training one straggler stalls the whole job.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 3,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
